{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">容天佑與太太 Winnie 今年迎來得意B女，本來一家三口相當幸福，點知近日竟然遇上「無良外傭走佬」的離奇經歷。容太在社交網大吐苦水，大爆工人姐姐趁她離港出 Trip，精心部署了一場極度荒謬的潛逃大計，最後更留下一屋爛攤子，令她極度崩潰。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"winniefu_1787031179_3966227096036232292_3766957.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026tiYfxNzD1x1789442737.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"winniefu_1787031179_3966227096036232292_3766957.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">事緣容太離開香港公幹七日，出 Trip 的第一日夜晚 11 點，老公容天佑收工返到屋企，竟然發現工人姐姐唔見人。容太心急如焚瘋狂 WhatsApp 及打電話聯絡，對方卻一直「已讀不回」甚至「單剔」。原來容天佑發現姐姐的衣櫃一早已經清空，枱面只留下一杯飲剩的咖啡及食了兩啖的方包，明顯是早有預謀的走佬大計！幸好容太出發前已將B女交由媽媽照顧，否則後果不堪設想。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">失聯去到第三日，姐姐終於蒲頭，更聲稱自己「一路都喺香港」，要求等女主人返港才解釋，突然有位香港國際機場的地勤人員接聽電話，爆出驚人真相：「你姐姐飛咗去某一個地方，但係俾人遣返咗，所以而家唔知道應該去邊！」事後姐姐更透過 Agent 要求容太「即刻買機票」讓她翌日返回菲律賓，態度令人咋舌。</p><p style=\"text-align: left; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"winniefu_1789383771_3985949527062074735_3766957.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026wYCU467OLN1789442736.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"winniefu_1789383771_3985949527062074735_3766957.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">除了平日工作態度極差與欠缺衛生，姐姐留下的爛攤子更令剛落機返港的容太極度崩潰。容太發現姐姐走佬前在BB房倒瀉咖啡，不但沒有清理，更惹到全房都係蟻，所有BB尿片及用品佈滿螞蟻，牆身及地板佈滿污漬兼發臭。最終所有尿片全部報廢，整個房間需要反轉重新大消毒滅蟻。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">最令容太擔憂的是，屋企連姐姐的合約文件都唔見埋，坦言：「希望一個月後唔會收到收數公司嘅信啦！」這次慘痛經歷令她不禁感嘆現時請好工人真係好難，直指僱主實在太缺乏保障。不少網民及媽媽粉絲睇見都大感同情，紛紛留言鬧爆該名外傭。</p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"winniefu_1789383771_3985949538225205441_3766957.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026By5pDSktxM1789442737.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"winniefu_1789383771_3985949538225205441_3766957.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"winniefu_1789383771_3985949537914676530_3766957.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026HUdyj1z3nO1789442736.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"winniefu_1789383771_3985949537914676530_3766957.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"winniefu_1789383771_3985949544113809032_3766957.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026LiGLt3Xwm11789442736.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"winniefu_1789383771_3985949544113809032_3766957.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"winniefu_1789383771_3985949547964370705_3766957.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026C38Y6Hsjqc1789442737.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"winniefu_1789383771_3985949547964370705_3766957.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-15T03:59:48.652436+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":683,"images":6,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}